 body+='<section><h2>Integration requirements and remaining acceptance</h2><p>The legacy Health backend still supplies KHC.Status, StatusDetail, LastScan, Baseline and Version only. LastScan is saved-state time; Baseline may still say Fresh baseline. The UI labels saved records explicitly and avoids unverified green, but complete healthy/active/historical/resolved/advisory/unknown/running/failed state distinctions require a verified backend contract. The prepared watched badge has no consumer or activated mutation.</p><p>Installed provider ownership, every original action on-device, dynamic native context placement during resize, Back/focus/touch/scroll, Home/player return, full theme/window transitions and comparative performance remain pending. No UI speed improvement or leak repair is claimed. Existing packed/legacy artwork references are unchanged and not confirmed as active missing assets.</p><p>Shared-file reconciliation is required for Includes.xml, Includes_InfinityLegacy.xml, View_50_List.xml and custom windows if the backend installer supplies its own skin overlays. Both branches must pass together before a combined release is accepted.</p><details><summary>Full integration contract, rollback and 90-minute device test procedure</summary><pre>'+esc((HERE/'integration-and-device-tests.md').read_text())+'</pre></details></section>'
